msgid "优化前的代码："
msgstr "Code before optimization:"

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:193
msgid "优化后的代码："
msgstr "Code after optimization:"

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:231
msgid "动态计算适合的 BLOCK_SIZE 以避免 coreDim 超限"
msgstr "Dynamically Calculating **BLOCK_SIZE** to Ensure **coreDim** Remains Within the Limit"

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:242
msgid "处理复合问题：coreDim + UB 溢出"
msgstr "Handling the Compound Issue: coreDim + UB Overflow"

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:244
msgid ""
"问题分析:   在某些情况下，解决了 coreDim 问题后可能引发新的UB溢出问题。这通常发生在增大 BLOCK_SIZE "
"后，单个线程块需要处理的数据量超出了NPU的UB缓存容量。"
msgstr "Issue analysis: In some scenarios, solving the **coreDim** limit issue may inadvertently trigger a new issue -- UB overflow. This typically occurs when increasing **BLOCK_SIZE** causes the data volume processed by a single thread block to exceed the UB cache capacity of NPUs."

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:247
msgid ""
"案例：     数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始 BLOCK_SIZE = 4096，计算得到的 coreDim = 262144 >"
" 65535（超限），调整为 BLOCK_SIZE = 32768 后，coreDim = 32768（合规），但出现 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Case: Data scale `N = 1073741824`; original `BLOCK_SIZE = 4096`; calculated `coreDim = 262144`, exceeding the limit of **65535**. After **BLOCK_SIZE** is adjusted to **32768**, **coreDim** is **32768** (within the limit), but UB overflow occurs."

#: ../../zh/migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md:250
msgid "解决思路：   引入 BLOCK_SIZE_SUB 参数，将大块进一步细分，在保持合理 coreDim 的同时控制内存使用。   优化前代码："
msgstr "Solution: Introduce the BLOCK_SIZE_SUB parameter to further subdivide large blocks, controlling memory usage while maintaining a reasonable coreDim. Code before optimization:"
"Solution: "
"Introduce the **BLOCK_SIZE_SUB** parameter to further subdivide large"
"blocks, thereby controlling memory usage while maintaining a reasonable"
"**coreDim**."
